Reaching out a hand toward that crescent moon

34
00:04:56,750 --> 00:05:00,008
ラララ… 君を知りたい声にならないおもいの朝を
Lalala... Welcoming the morning of unspoken feelings wanting to know you

35
00:05:00,508 --> 00:05:03,508
たとえ何度迎えようとも
No matter how many times I face it...

36
00:05:07,708 --> 00:05:11,508
夢ならば覚めないで現実なんてさ 何も面白くないから
If it's a dream, don't wake me up, because reality isn't interesting at all.

37
00:05:17,208 --> 00:05:20,508
時は誰も待ってくれないの
Time waits for no one.

38
00:05:42,008 --> 00:05:44,808
無敵の笑顔で荒らすメディア
Tearing through the media with an invincible smile,

39
00:05:45,008 --> 00:05:47,008
知りたいその秘密ミステリアス
I want to know your secret, so mysterious.

40
00:05:47,208 --> 00:05:50,008
抜けてるとこさえ彼女のエリア
Even your airheaded moments are part of her domain.

41
00:05:50,208 --> 00:05:53,008
完璧で嘘つきな君は
You, so perfect and telling lies,

42
00:05:53,208 --> 00:05:56,008
天才的なアイドル様
Are a genius idol-sama!

43
00:05:58,808 --> 00:06:01,808
今日何食べた? 好きな本は?
What did you eat today? What's your favorite book?

44
00:06:02,008 --> 00:06:05,008
遊びに行くならどこに行くの?
If you go out to play, where do you go?

45
00:06:05,208 --> 00:06:07,008
何も食べてない
I haven't eaten anything.

46
00:06:07,108 --> 00:06:09,908
それは内緒
That's a secret.

47
00:06:10,008 --> 00:06:13,508
何を聞かれてものらりくらり
No matter what you ask me, I dodge it evasively.

48
00:06:13,708 --> 00:06:15,808
そう綺麗ごとだけ
Just pretty words,

49
00:06:16,008 --> 00:06:18,808
嘘でみせない秘密は蜜の味
Secrets hidden behind lies taste like honey.

50
00:06:19,008 --> 00:06:21,808
あれもないないない これもないないない
There's none of that, none of this either.

51
00:06:22,008 --> 00:06:25,008
好きなタイプは? 相手は? さあ答えて
What's your type? Who is the partner? Come on, answer!

52
00:06:25,208 --> 00:06:29,808
「誰かを好きになることなんて私分からないからさ」
"I don't even know what it's like to fall in love with someone,"

53
00:06:30,008 --> 00:06:33,008
嘘か本当か知り得ない
You can never tell if it's a lie or the truth.

54
00:06:33,208 --> 00:06:36,508
そんな言葉にまた一人踊る
Everyone dances to those words once again,

55
00:06:36,708 --> 00:06:39,808
誰もが目を奪われていく
As everyone's eyes are stolen away.

56
00:06:40,008 --> 00:06:44,508
君は完璧で究極のアイドル
You are the perfect, ultimate idol!

57
00:06:44,708 --> 00:06:48,508
金輪際現れない 一番星の生まれ変わり
An incarnation of the North Star who will never appear again.

58
00:06:48,708 --> 00:06:53,008
その笑顔で愛してるで
With that smile, saying "I love you,"

59
00:06:53,208 --> 00:06:57,008
誰も彼も虜にしていく
You captivate everyone and anyone.

60
00:06:57,208 --> 00:07:00,008
その瞳が その言葉が
That gaze, those words,

61
00:07:00,208 --> 00:07:02,508
嘘でもそれは完全なアイ
Even if they're lies, that's pure love.

62
00:07:02,808 --> 00:07:05,508
はいはいあの子は特別です
Yes, yes, that girl is special.

63
00:07:05,708 --> 00:07:08,808
我々はハナからおまけです
We were just supporting cast from the very start.

64
00:07:09,008 --> 00:07:11,508
お星様の引き立て役Bです
I'm supporting role B to the stars.

65
00:07:11,708 --> 00:07:15,508
全てがあの子のおかげなわけない
There's no way it's all thanks to that girl.

66
00:07:15,708 --> 00:07:19,908
妬み嫉妬なんてない わけがない これこそネタじゃない
Of course there's jealousy and envy, this isn't a joke!

67
00:07:20,108 --> 00:07:22,508
だからこそ許せない
That's precisely why I can't forgive it.

68
00:07:22,708 --> 00:07:25,508
完璧じゃない 君じゃ許せない
I can't forgive you if you're not perfect.

69
00:07:25,708 --> 00:07:28,508
自分を許せない
I can't forgive myself either.

70
00:07:28,708 --> 00:07:30,508
誰よりも強い 君を淀めない
I won't let you, stronger than anyone, falter.

71
00:07:30,708 --> 00:07:34,008
誰しもが信じ崇めてる
Everyone believes in and worships you,

72
00:07:34,208 --> 00:07:37,008
まさに最強で無敵のアイドル
Truly the strongest and invincible idol!

73
00:07:37,208 --> 00:07:39,508
弱点なんて見当たらない
Not a single weakness can be found.

74
00:07:39,708 --> 00:07:43,508
一番星を宿している
Housing the North Star within.

75
00:07:43,708 --> 00:07:45,908
弱いとこなんて見せちゃダメダメ
You mustn't ever show your weak sides.

76
00:07:46,008 --> 00:07:49,008
知りたくないところは見せずに
Without showing the parts people don't want to know,

77
00:07:49,208 --> 00:07:52,508
唯一無二じゃなくちゃイヤイヤ
You have to be one and only, no exceptions!

78
00:07:52,708 --> 00:07:55,508
それこそ本物の愛
That right there is true love.

79
00:07:55,708 --> 00:07:58,508
得意の笑顔で沸かすメディア
Stirring up the media with your signature smile,

80
00:07:58,708 --> 00:08:01,508
隠しきるこの秘密だけは
Hiding away this secret and nothing else.

81
00:08:01,708 --> 00:08:04,508
愛してるって嘘で積むキャリア
Building a career on the lie that "I love you."

82
00:08:04,708 --> 00:08:07,508
これこそ私の愛だ
This is truly my love.

83
00:08:07,708 --> 00:08:10,008
流れる汗も綺麗なアクア
Even the flowing sweat is a beautiful aqua,

84
00:08:10,208 --> 00:08:13,508
ルビーを隠したこの瞼
These eyelids that hid the ruby.

85
00:08:13,708 --> 00:08:17,008
歌い踊り舞う私はマリア
Singing, dancing, and twirling, I am Maria.

86
00:08:17,208 --> 00:08:20,508
そう嘘はとびきりの愛だ
Yes, lies are the ultimate form of love.

87
00:08:20,708 --> 00:08:25,008
誰かに愛されたことも 誰かのこと愛したことも
Being loved by someone, or loving someone,

88
00:08:25,208 --> 00:08:28,508
ないそんな私の嘘が いつか本当になること
Such lies of mine, I pray they will one day become the truth.

89
00:08:28,708 --> 00:08:31,008
信じてる
I believe in it.

90
00:08:31,208 --> 00:08:34,508
いつかきっと全部手に入れる
Someday I'll surely get my hands on everything.

91
00:08:34,708 --> 00:08:38,008
私はそう欲張りなアイドル
I am such a greedy idol!

92
00:08:38,208 --> 00:08:41,508
等身大でみんなのこと ちゃんと愛したいから
Because I want to properly love everyone just as I am,

93
00:08:41,708 --> 00:08:45,008
今日も嘘をつくの
Today, too, I tell a lie.

94
00:08:45,208 --> 00:08:49,008
この言葉がいつか本当に成る日を願って
Hoping for the day these words will truly become real.

95
00:08:49,208 --> 00:08:52,508
それでもまた 君と君にだけは言えずにいたけど
Even so, I still couldn't say it to you and only you...

96
00:08:52,708 --> 00:08:56,508
ああ やっと言えた
Ah, I was finally able to say it.

97
00:08:56,708 --> 00:09:00,008
これは絶対嘘じゃない
This is definitely not a lie.

98
00:09:49,508 --> 00:09:55,208
声にならない声を上げて
Raising a voice that cannot become words,

99
00:09:55,508 --> 00:10:00,016
闇を切り裂くように
As if tearing through the darkness...

100
00:10:10,366 --> 00:10:20,316
魂の欲望に手を伸ばし続けて 夢を見る
Reaching out for desires of the soul, keeping on dreaming...

101
00:10:21,016 --> 00:10:30,216
何百回もそう、急いで 涙じみた迷路の中に
Hundreds of times, hurrying through a tear-soaked maze...

102
00:10:30,216 --> 00:10:41,516
隠されたまま 希望の淵に飲まれて 沈んでしまった 本当の答えを
Remains hidden, swallowed by the depths of hope, sinking down... searching for the real answer

103
00:10:41,516 --> 00:10:45,516
探し続けながら
while continuing to search...

104
00:10:46,016 --> 00:10:56,516
何百回でも遮るモノに翳してみせる 僕の願い必ず君に伝える日まで
No matter how many times, I'll hold it up against whatever blocks the way. My wish, until the day I surely reach you—

105
00:10:57,016 --> 00:11:02,516
正しさは譲れないから 進み続けてゆくの
Because righteousness cannot be surrendered, I will keep moving forward.

106
00:11:03,016 --> 00:11:13,016
何度でも迷いの中で 目指して いつか黎明の元へ帰る時まで
No matter how many times, wandering through doubt, aiming towards the dawn until the day I return...

107
00:11:13,516 --> 00:11:18,516
痛む泥濘の中で祈りを描くよ
Painting prayers amid the aching mire...

108
00:11:19,016 --> 00:11:24,516
心配ないと言い聞かせながら今
Telling ourselves not to worry, right now—

109
00:11:25,016 --> 00:11:31,016
歩き出すのさ
We take a step forward...

110
00:11:41,216 --> 00:11:49,016
冷たい約束の絵を 繋がり合わせた道を行く
Walking the path where pictures of cold promises are connected together...

111
00:11:52,016 --> 00:12:03,016
重ね合う夢に息吐く場所などない 怯えながら
There's nowhere to breathe in overlapping dreams, trembling...

112
00:12:04,016 --> 00:12:12,516
鼓動は光求めて 不自由な軌道を選んだ それが
Heartbeats seeking light, choosing an unfettered trajectory—that is...

113
00:12:13,016 --> 00:12:16,516
今を苦しめても
Even if it tortures the present...

114
00:12:17,016 --> 00:12:22,516
もう一回はない! 愚かな程に望んでしまう 光る世界
There is no second time! Foolishly wishing for a glowing world...

115
00:12:23,016 --> 00:12:33,016
抱えて押し潰され掛けても 後悔なら呆れるほど繰り返してきたけど
Even if held and nearly crushed, though we've repeated regrets to the point of numbness—

116
00:12:33,516 --> 00:12:38,516
真実は失いたくないから
Because we don't want to lose the truth...

117
00:12:39,016 --> 00:12:44,016
歪な運命の中に囚われている
Trapped within a distorted destiny...

118
00:12:44,516 --> 00:12:55,016
荒ぶる人生を共にあなたと歩くよ 涙の果ては此処ではないとまだ
Walking a wild life together with you. The end of tears is not yet here, still—

119
00:12:55,516 --> 00:12:59,516
夜を渡っていく
Crossing over the night...

120
00:13:10,016 --> 00:13:20,516
あの日僕らが出会った時に見た大きな夢は 二人のレンズにはそれぞれの景色だった それでもなぜか二人には美しく見えて 心が固くなってどうしようもなく叫びたくなったのは今でも覚えている
The big dreams we saw when we first met that day looked like different sceneries through our respective lenses. Yet somehow, to both of us, it looked so beautiful that our hearts hardened, and we wanted to scream helplessly—I still remember that.

121
00:13:20,516 --> 00:13:30,016
知らなきゃきっとそれだけで過不足ないから 打ち続くという限りないし家に追いかけながら 何も間違いじゃない 声を振るわせ歌いながら 君の手を引く 今は生き抜くことができたら
If we hadn't known, surely that alone would be neither too much nor too little, so chasing after an endless house called continuation... Without any mistakes, shaking our voices while singing, pulling your hand. If we can survive right now—

122
00:13:31,016 --> 00:13:37,516
深い、深い旅をしよう
Let's take a deep, deep journey...

123
00:13:38,016 --> 00:13:43,016
その先はほとんど分からないかもしれないし
We might barely know what lies ahead, and...

124
00:13:43,016 --> 00:13:49,016
その先はほとんど光なんか見えないかもしれないけど
We might barely see any light ahead, but...

125
00:13:49,016 --> 00:13:56,516
微かな足取りで握ることなどできなかったから 最後の最後にやっと同じ答えにたどり着くまで
Since we couldn't grasp it with feeble steps, until we finally reached the exact same answer at the very end...

126
00:13:57,016 --> 00:14:05,516
苦しみさえ引き連れて 深層へ...
Bringing even the pain along, into the deep layers...

127
00:14:06,016 --> 00:14:16,516
何百回でも遮るモノに翳してみせる 僕の願い必ず君に伝える日まで
No matter how many times, I'll hold it up against whatever blocks the way. My wish, until the day I surely reach you—

128
00:14:17,016 --> 00:14:22,516
正しさは譲れないから 進み続けてゆくの
Because righteousness cannot be surrendered, I will keep moving forward.

129
00:14:23,016 --> 00:14:32,516
何度でも迷いの中で 目指して いつか黎明の元へ帰る時まで
No matter how many times, wandering through doubt, aiming towards the dawn until the day I return...

130
00:14:33,016 --> 00:14:37,516
痛む泥濘の中で祈りを描くよ
Painting prayers amid the aching mire...

131
00:14:38,016 --> 00:14:44,016
心配ないと言い聞かせながら今
Telling ourselves not to worry, right now—

132
00:14:44,516 --> 00:14:52,016
歩き出すのさ たった一つの朝焼け手にいれるの
We take a step forward, claiming that single morning glow...

133
00:15:39,779 --> 00:15:43,069
陰にそっと隠れようが いいんじゃない？
It's fine to quietly hide in the shadows, right?

134
00:15:44,199 --> 00:15:47,809
蕾のような花だっていいんじゃない？
It's fine to be a flower like a bud, right?

135
00:15:49,359 --> 00:15:52,639
秘密にして守るのがいいんじゃない？
Keeping it a secret and protecting it is fine, right?

136
00:15:54,049 --> 00:15:58,779
誰にも邪魔させず 綺麗に咲いてる
Blooming beautifully without letting anyone disturb you.

137
00:15:59,719 --> 00:16:03,969
甘い苦いにハマんない その判断がくだんない
Not getting hooked on sweet and bitter, that judgment is pointless.

138
00:16:04,649 --> 00:16:08,879
気に病んで下を向かないでいて
Don't worry and look down.

139
00:16:09,819 --> 00:16:13,939
愛になりたいない 無駄に重んない
I don't want to become love, I don't want to weigh it down uselessly.

140
00:16:14,799 --> 00:16:19,519
綺麗にされた花瓶も 肥やしも何もいらない
I don't need a nicely decorated vase, nor fertilizer, nor anything.

141
00:16:19,919 --> 00:16:22,609
その姿が美しい
That appearance is beautiful.

142
00:16:23,029 --> 00:16:26,339
花になって
Become a flower.

143
00:16:26,679 --> 00:16:31,009
ニヒルに笑って その顔に
Laugh cynically at that face.

144
00:16:31,359 --> 00:16:35,329
ざっくざくして目は離せない 味見して
Crunching away, I can't take my eyes off you, tasting it.

145
00:16:35,809 --> 00:16:42,049
君の毒は私の薬って 包んであげるから笑って
Your poison is my medicine, so I'll wrap you up, so smile.

146
00:16:49,259 --> 00:16:52,909
逢いたい逢いたいって その笑顔に
Saying "I want to see you, I want to see you" to that smile.

147
00:16:53,719 --> 00:16:58,939
逢いたい逢いたいって言えば笑ってくれるかな
If I say "I want to see you, I want to see you", will you smile for me?

148
00:16:59,819 --> 00:17:03,979
からさ支える辛いはいいんじゃない？
Isn't it fine if the spice that supports me is spicy?

149
00:17:04,519 --> 00:17:08,879
横を言えばこの手で咲かせてみたい
If I have a selfish wish, I want to try making it bloom with my own hands.

150
00:17:09,319 --> 00:17:14,229
病人のように心を 喰らう花
A flower that devours the heart like a sick person.

151
00:17:14,849 --> 00:17:21,039
枯らしたくないのさ 枯らしたくないのさ
I don't want it to wither, I don't want it to wither.

152
00:17:22,139 --> 00:17:26,319
光が届かずとも
Even if the light doesn't reach,

153
00:17:26,679 --> 00:17:32,439
水をあげ続けるから
I'll keep giving it water.

154
00:17:34,649 --> 00:17:37,239
一・加減に気付いて
Realizing the moderation,

155
00:17:37,719 --> 00:17:43,339
君は知って切って 自惚れてもっとお大事に
You knew it, full of yourself, take better care of yourself.

156
00:17:44,229 --> 00:17:49,149
無茶苦茶なまま 愛を蓄え合って
Accumulating love while it's still a mess.

157
00:17:49,779 --> 00:17:54,329
綺麗にされた花瓶も 肥やしも何もいらない
I don't need a nicely decorated vase, nor fertilizer, nor anything.

158
00:17:54,839 --> 00:17:58,379
その姿で咲き誇れ
Bloom proudly in that appearance.

159
00:18:00,679 --> 00:18:03,979
花になって
Become a flower.

160
00:18:04,249 --> 00:18:10,039
ニヒルに笑って その顔に ざっくざくして目の離せない
Laugh cynically at that face, can't take my eyes off you.

161
00:18:10,579 --> 00:18:15,139
味見して 君の毒は私の薬って
Tasting it, your poison is my medicine.

162
00:18:15,679 --> 00:18:20,179
包んであげるから笑って
So I'll wrap you up, so smile.

163
00:18:20,719 --> 00:18:25,439
無茶苦茶にして 君の闇は私の光って
Making it a mess, your darkness is my light.

164
00:18:25,779 --> 00:18:30,879
愛してあげたら笑って
So if I love you, smile.

165
00:19:55,779 --> 00:19:59,879
パイナップルじゃまだ足りないな
Pineapples alone still aren't enough!

166
00:20:00,243 --> 00:20:02,163
世界だって見た今日を
Today, which even the world saw,

167
00:20:02,163 --> 00:20:06,043
境界線はもうどこにもない
there are no longer any boundaries anywhere.

168
00:20:06,043 --> 00:20:09,003
感情のシグナルをみんな伝えるよ
I'll convey the signal of my emotions to everyone,

169
00:20:09,003 --> 00:20:12,783
応えてよ 鳴り止まないの
answer me, it won't stop ringing!

170
00:20:12,783 --> 00:20:15,603
七色の衝動 エモーション・グラビティ
A rainbow-colored impulse, emotion gravity—

171
00:20:15,603 --> 00:20:21,083
君に届いているから もう一歩だよ
because it's reaching you, we're just one step away.

172
00:20:21,863 --> 00:20:26,603
感情的コミュニケーション 見つけてみて 声の中の
Try to find an emotional communication inside our voices—

173
00:20:26,603 --> 00:20:32,103
キューラナどこ 響きあって見せて 声の中の
somewhere at Q-Lana, resonating within our voices!

174
00:20:32,103 --> 00:20:35,343
世界はどこ... 鳴らせハイファイな想いと
Where is the world...? Ring out with high-fi feelings,

175
00:20:35,343 --> 00:20:40,023
次元を越え胸打つメロディ そしてリアルな秘密を教えよう
a melody that transcends dimensions and strikes the heart! And let me tell you a real secret—

176
00:20:50,023 --> 00:20:52,843
この歌はどこへ生き行くよ
this song is heading somewhere,

177
00:20:52,843 --> 00:20:57,043
だから逢いたいなんてなぜ 指切りしようよ 君のメモリーに
so why do I want to see you? Let's make a pinky promise on your memories!

178
00:20:59,823 --> 00:21:03,303
ほら 君が私を呼ぶなら
Look, if you're calling out to me,

179
00:21:03,303 --> 00:21:07,903
耳澄まして
listen closely!

180
00:21:27,243 --> 00:21:33,303
喧嘩ばかりじゃ退屈だから 手を下げて 下げて
Fighting all the time is boring, so put your hands down, down!

181
00:21:33,303 --> 00:21:40,003
一人きりじゃそんな壁はもう強要しない
Alone, you won't enforce a wall like that anymore—

182
00:21:40,003 --> 00:21:46,443
一緒に揺れようそれが歌だから 隠してよ
let's sway together because that's what a song is! Keep it hidden,

183
00:21:46,443 --> 00:21:51,543
共鳴昨日のエモーションレスキュー
resonating yesterday's emotion rescue!

184
00:21:53,643 --> 00:21:57,443
君にちゃんと見えるかな もう手を振って
Can you see me clearly? Wave your hands now—

185
00:21:57,443 --> 00:22:03,143
感情的感情はダイレクトに見つけた 滅亡してる
emotional emotions, I found them directly, heading to ruin—

186
00:22:03,143 --> 00:22:08,543
それが君のキューラナとこ
that is your Q-Lana place!

187
00:22:10,543 --> 00:22:16,443
響けアッパナーリズンで 強制的に上げてくハートビート
Echo with an uppana-rhythm, forcibly raising our heartbeats!

188
00:22:16,443 --> 00:22:21,043
ごめんねでも好きでいてほしいんだ
Sorry, but I want you to keep loving me—

189
00:22:21,043 --> 00:22:26,543
君のためだけに歌うから なぜかちょっと泣けちゃって
I'll sing just for you, so why am I crying a little bit?

190
00:22:26,543 --> 00:22:31,543
君が笑ってくれたせいだけど
It's only because you smiled for me...

191
00:22:31,543 --> 00:22:39,943
そっと通じ合える温かさは初めてから
The warmth of connecting gently is something I felt for the very first time!

192
00:22:52,043 --> 00:22:56,043
言葉と違って私は誰でしょう
Unlike words, who am I?

193
00:22:56,043 --> 00:22:58,943
声を頼りに探してよ
Search for me relying on my voice!

194
00:22:58,943 --> 00:23:04,943
心で歌うよ 心に届いて欲しいよ
I'll sing from my heart, I want it to reach your heart—

195
00:23:04,943 --> 00:23:09,943
夢もリアルも本当だよ
both dreams and reality are real!

196
00:23:13,143 --> 00:23:19,043
鳴らせハイファイな想いと 次元を越え胸打つメロディ
Ring out with high-fi feelings, a melody that transcends dimensions and strikes the heart!

197
00:23:19,043 --> 00:23:25,043
そしてリアルな秘密を教えよう この歌は終わり生き行くよ
And let me tell you a real secret, this song will live on until the end!

198
00:23:25,043 --> 00:23:30,043
だから逢いたいなんてなぜ 指切りしようよ 君のメモリーに
So why do I want to see you? Let's make a pinky promise on your memories!

199
00:23:30,043 --> 00:23:35,043
ほら 君が私を呼ぶなら 耳澄まして
Look, if you're calling out to me, listen closely!

200
00:23:35,043 --> 00:23:41,043
いつも座っているよ 手を締めるを上げて
I'm always sitting here, raising our clenched hands high!

201
00:24:31,132 --> 00:24:45,032
やさしい言葉をあなたがあくれた
You gave me such gentle words...

202
00:24:48,032 --> 00:24:59,532
寂しげな時には抱きしめてくれて
and when I felt lonely, you held me close...

203
00:25:00,390 --> 00:25:09,290
哀しいこともあったけど
There were sad things too, but...

204
00:25:10,890 --> 00:25:18,590
浅い春の喜びも二人で
The joy of early spring, the two of us...

205
00:25:18,790 --> 00:25:21,590
分け合った
Shared together.

206
00:25:22,540 --> 00:25:28,490
時が終わる前に
Before time comes to an end,

207
00:25:28,890 --> 00:25:34,490
遠い一人 残したい言葉を探した
I searched for words to leave behind for you, far away.

208
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:42,540
ありがとうとただ繰り返し
Just repeating "thank you" over and over,

209
00:25:42,940 --> 00:25:54,590
それだけが貴方の胸に 届けばいい
I hope only that feeling reaches your heart.

210
00:27:26,140 --> 00:27:32,040
smile for you

211
00:28:36,840 --> 00:28:41,540
[Title: ユグドラシル]
[Title: Yggdrasil]

212
00:28:36,840 --> 00:28:42,040
ティララ ツラララ ティリラ ラツララ
Tirala turalala tirira latsurala

213
00:28:42,140 --> 00:28:47,040
ティリリ ツラララ タリラ ルラティラ
Tiriri turalala tarira luratira

214
00:28:47,140 --> 00:28:51,540
ティララ ツラララ ティリラ ラツララ
Tirala turalala tirira latsurala

215
00:28:51,640 --> 00:28:57,540
ティリリ ツラララ タリラ ルラティラ
Tiriri turalala tarira luratira

216
00:29:03,540 --> 00:29:13,540
世界の果ての 祈る黄昏の雲より
Beyond the twilight clouds at the end of the world,

217
00:29:14,040 --> 00:29:18,540
永遠の果てへ
To the ends of eternity...

218
00:29:18,840 --> 00:29:23,540
旅立つは歌声
A song sets off on a journey.

219
00:29:24,040 --> 00:29:29,040
季節は巡りて
The seasons turn and go round,

220
00:29:29,540 --> 00:29:34,540
種はいつか芽生えて 今守り
Seeds will someday sprout, protecting the present...

221
00:29:35,040 --> 00:29:45,040
見送る花は身を遺す
The flowers seeing us off leave their bodies behind.

222
00:29:46,040 --> 00:29:55,040
時の泉に 消えてゆくのを ただ一人だけ覚えていよう
Remembering all alone how they fade away into the fountain of time...

223
00:29:55,540 --> 00:29:59,540
ここに誰かが確かに
Someone was surely here...

224
00:30:00,096 --> 00:30:06,176
確かにいたと 古代のしらべは
The ancient melody of when you were truly there...

225
00:30:07,176 --> 00:30:11,756
明日を歌うだろう
...will sing of tomorrow.

226
00:30:13,256 --> 00:30:16,876
稲妻を行く
Going through the lightning,

227
00:30:17,256 --> 00:30:23,756
風を追う 快足のバラード
chasing the wind, the swift ballad.

228
00:30:24,116 --> 00:30:27,756
荒野の歩み
Walking the wilderness

229
00:30:28,056 --> 00:30:33,016
凍りついた奇跡のほとり
near the frozen miracle.

230
00:30:33,916 --> 00:30:39,196
不思議を追って 落ちたおなじの
Chasing wonders, the fallen omen

231
00:30:39,476 --> 00:30:44,256
世界の秘密 散りさばかれている
the secrets of the world are scattered.

232
00:30:44,256 --> 00:30:49,756
過去も未来も 幻だから
Both past and future are illusions, so

233
00:30:50,096 --> 00:30:55,036
いつでも君に 愛に生きるよ
I will live for love with you anytime.

234
00:30:55,376 --> 00:31:00,496
季節は巡りて
The seasons go round,

235
00:31:00,836 --> 00:31:04,976
友は先によりゆき
friends go ahead,

236
00:31:05,236 --> 00:31:07,776
陸巡り
traveling the lands,

237
00:31:08,136 --> 00:31:11,496
見送り
seeing them off.

238
00:31:11,876 --> 00:31:16,476
いつも残されて
Always left behind,

239
00:31:16,696 --> 00:31:21,896
君の皮も 森に返そう
returning your pelt to the forest.

240
00:31:21,896 --> 00:31:27,956
いつか世界中のもとで会う
We will meet again someday in all the world.

241
00:31:28,316 --> 00:31:36,676
その時までは さようならだから 一粒の涙を
Until that time, it's goodbye, so shedding a single teardrop

242
00:31:37,816 --> 00:31:42,556
時の水面に 消えてゆくの
fading into the surface of the waters of time.

243
00:31:42,876 --> 00:31:48,416
ただ一人だけ覚えているよ
I remember you, and you alone.

244
00:31:48,696 --> 00:31:54,816
ここには君が 確かにいたと
You were definitely here,

245
00:31:54,816 --> 00:31:58,756
古代のしらべは
the ancient melody

246
00:31:59,096 --> 00:32:04,196
明日を歌うだろう
will sing of tomorrow.

247
00:32:05,156 --> 00:32:09,996
世界の果ての
At the edge of the world,

248
00:32:10,256 --> 00:32:15,596
大いなる木を
praising and singing

249
00:32:15,816 --> 00:32:22,048
讃えて歌おう
of the great tree.

250
00:32:36,548 --> 00:32:44,548
[Title: 花の唄
Lyrics, Music: 梶浦由記]
[Title: Hana no Uta
Lyrics, Music: Yuki Kajiura]

251
00:33:08,548 --> 00:33:14,248
その日たちは夢のように
Those days were like a dream,

252
00:33:14,948 --> 00:33:22,748
臆病な微笑みと やさしい爪を残して行った
leaving behind a timid smile and gentle claws.

253
00:33:27,248 --> 00:33:32,448
退屈な花びらのように
Like tedious flower petals,

254
00:33:33,148 --> 00:33:43,048
くるしみを忘れて 貴方の背中でそっと 泣いて笑った
forgetting the pain, I softly cried and laughed on your back.

255
00:33:49,248 --> 00:33:55,248
帰らぬ日々を思うような
Like thinking of days that will never return,

256
00:33:56,248 --> 00:34:06,148
奇妙な愛しさに満たされた箱庭の中で 息をひそめ
holding my breath inside a miniature garden filled with strange affection.

257
00:34:13,548 --> 00:34:18,848
季節がゆくことを忘れ
Forgetting that the seasons pass by,

258
00:34:19,548 --> 00:34:30,048
静かな水底のような 時間にいた
I was in a time like the quiet depths of the water.

259
00:34:32,848 --> 00:34:44,548
冷たい花びら 夜に散り咲く まるで白い雪のようだね 切なく貴方の上に降った
Cold petals blooming and scattering in the night, just like white snow, sorrowfully falling upon you.

260
00:34:47,048 --> 00:34:55,048
かなしみを全て 洗い流してあげたいだけ
I just want to wash away all of your sadness.

261
00:34:56,548 --> 00:35:00,048
あなたのこと 傷つけるもの...
Things that hurt you...

262
00:35:00,410 --> 00:35:07,190
貴方のこと 傷つけるもの全て 私はきっと 許すことはできない
I surely cannot forgive anything that hurts you.

263
00:35:08,610 --> 00:35:18,550
優しい日々 涙が出るほど 帰りたい あなたと ふたりで見上げた
I want to return to those gentle days, to the point of tears... looking up together with you.

264
00:35:19,510 --> 00:35:23,690
花びらが散った
as the flower petals scattered.

265
00:35:33,310 --> 00:35:46,650
月が雲に隠れて 貴方は道を失して 泣き出しそうな
The moon hides behind the clouds, and you lose your way, looking as if you're about to cry.

266
00:35:47,830 --> 00:35:54,970
目をしていた ざぎざぎなこころだって
Even with a jagged heart...

267
00:35:56,610 --> 00:36:07,090
ふたつ合わせてみれば 優しいものがきっと
If we put the two together, surely gentle things...

268
00:36:08,630 --> 00:36:25,190
生まれてくるわ 私を傷つけるものを 貴方は許さないでくれた
will be born. You refused to forgive anything that hurts me...

269
00:36:26,230 --> 00:36:32,010
それだけでいいの
...that alone is enough.

270
00:36:57,430 --> 00:37:07,630
川面に伸ばされた 貴方の手にしがみ付いた
I clung to your hand that reached out over the river's surface.

271
00:37:08,630 --> 00:37:21,890
諦めていた世界に やがて温かな灯がともる
In a world I had given up on, a warm light eventually ignites.

272
00:37:24,090 --> 00:37:28,970
冷たい花びら 夜を切り裂く
Cold flower petals tear through the night.

273
00:37:29,890 --> 00:37:46,090
私が摘んだ光を みんな束ねて 貴方のの上に全部 喜びのように撒き散らしてあげたいだけ
I just want to gather all the light I plucked and scatter it all over you like joy.

274
00:37:47,390 --> 00:37:58,790
悪いことをしたらきっと貴方が 怒ってくれると約束したよね
You promised that if I did something bad, you would surely scold me, didn't you?

275
00:37:59,910 --> 00:38:22,150
だからきっともう一度 私を見つけてくれるよね 寂しいところに もういなくていいの ひとりで見上げた花びらが散った
So I'm sure you'll find me once more. I no longer need to be in a lonely place... as the flower petals we looked up at scattered.

276
00:39:43,400 --> 00:39:47,420
迷子 迷子 まっただなかさ パラノイア
Lost, lost, right in the middle of paranoia!

277
00:39:47,420 --> 00:39:52,980
ぎこぎこ まいこころ でんて パラノイア
Creaky, creaky, dancing heart, turning round and round, paranoia!

278
00:39:52,980 --> 00:39:58,580
体温 体温 たったから まった パラノイア
Body temperature, body temperature, just starting up again, paranoia!

279
00:39:58,580 --> 00:40:00,064
さくさくさくさく
Crunch, crunch, crunch, crunch...

280
00:40:00,542 --> 00:40:03,492
さあ説教だ 感情論ばっかで語るなよ
Now for a lecture, stop speaking purely in emotion!

281
00:40:03,492 --> 00:40:06,252
踊れ踊れ 踊れ踊れ 揺ら揺ら
Dance and dance, dance and dance, swaying around

282
00:40:06,252 --> 00:40:09,202
ぱっぱっパグ さあバグバグ パッタパグを さいのうのたぐ
Pa-pa-pug, now bug-bug, patta-pug, a talent's kind...

283
00:40:09,202 --> 00:40:12,082
はっはっはぐ 感性はぐ 感性狂しは いやいやいやいや
Ha-ha-hug, sensibility hug, corrupted sensibility, no no no no!

284
00:40:12,082 --> 00:40:15,062
まんざらでもない 感情論ばっかで語るなよ 踊れ踊れ 踊れ踊れ 揺ら揺ら
Not half bad either, stop speaking purely in emotion, dance and dance, dance and dance, swaying around

285
00:40:15,062 --> 00:40:18,002
バグったって爪を立てたろ 溺れ溺れで いやいやいやいや
Even if it bugs out, bare your claws, drowning and drowning, no no no no!

286
00:40:18,002 --> 00:40:20,832
ぱっぱっパグ さあバグバグ パッタパグを さいのうのたぐ
Pa-pa-pug, now bug-bug, patta-pug, a talent's kind...

287
00:40:20,832 --> 00:40:23,702
見つめ合いたい いないいないばあ いないいないばっ海
Wanting to gaze at each other, peek-a-boo, peek-a-boo...

288
