見つめ合いたい いないいないばあ いないいないばっ海
Wanting to gaze at each other, peek-a-boo, peek-a-boo...

292
00:40:48,396 --> 00:40:54,016
ぱっぱっパグ さあバグバグ パッタパグを さいのうのたぐ 散々聞いて散々迷って 千年迷宮の真骨頂ね
Pa-pa-pug, now bug-bug, patta-pug, a talent's kind, hearing it all and getting totally lost, the true essence of a thousand-year labyrinth

293
00:40:54,016 --> 00:40:59,786
ぱっぱっパグ さあバグバグ パッタパグを さいのうのたぐ 愛の行く末は いやいやいやいや
Pa-pa-pug, now bug-bug, patta-pug, a talent's kind, where love leads is no no no no!

294
00:40:59,786 --> 00:41:02,196
エンドレスやみえ
Endless darkness...

295
00:41:02,196 --> 00:41:05,216
抱っこ抱っこ痛くないよ 語れ語れ語れ語れ パラノイア
Hold me, hold me, it doesn't hurt, talk and talk and talk and talk, paranoia!

296
00:41:05,216 --> 00:41:08,036
いっぽいっぽ頑張れの罠
One step, two step, the trap of doing your best

297
00:41:08,036 --> 00:41:11,036
踏み込むミニストレスあわ
Stepping into mini-stress bubbles

298
00:41:11,036 --> 00:41:14,136
ぱっぱっパグ さあバグバグ パッタパグを さいのうのたぐ
Pa-pa-pug, now bug-bug, patta-pug, a talent's kind...

299
00:41:14,136 --> 00:41:20,046
らんらんらぐ 乱打村ぐ ろんろんろぐ 半個のログ
Ran-ran-rag, ramming village rug, ron-ron-log, half a log...

300
00:41:20,046 --> 00:41:23,926
ぱっぱっパグ さあバグバグ パッタパグ パラノイア パラノイア パラノイア
Pa-pa-pug, now bug-bug, patta-pug, paranoia, paranoia, paranoia!

301
00:41:23,926 --> 00:41:27,596
さあ説教だ 感情論ばっかで語るなよ
Now for a lecture, stop speaking purely in emotion!

302
00:41:27,596 --> 00:41:30,466
踊れ踊れ 踊れ踊れ 揺ら揺ら
Dance and dance, dance and dance, swaying around

303
00:41:30,466 --> 00:41:35,896
左に右にゆくえもぐるぐる 無茶苦茶に詰め込んだら やたらめたら
Wandering left and right in circles, stuffing it all messily, recklessly...

304
00:41:35,896 --> 00:41:39,176
夜に迷い込め いないないばあ いないいないぽってん
Get lost in the night, peek-a-boo, peek-a-pot...

305
00:41:39,176 --> 00:41:42,216
さあ説教だ 感情論ばっかで語るなよ 踊れ踊れ 踊れ踊れ 揺ら揺ら
Now for a lecture, stop speaking purely in emotion, dance and dance, dance and dance, swaying around

306
00:41:42,216 --> 00:41:47,946
バグったって爪を立てたろ 溺れ溺れで いやいやいやいや
Even if it bugs out, bare your claws, drowning and drowning, no no no no!

307
00:41:47,946 --> 00:41:51,006
ここでかりはてて いあいあいあいあ
Harvesting here, yeah yeah yeah yeah...

308
00:41:51,006 --> 00:41:54,006
ぱっぱっパグ さあバグバグ パッタパグを さいのうのたぐ
Pa-pa-pug, now bug-bug, patta-pug, a talent's kind...

309
00:41:54,006 --> 00:42:00,046
手を取り合って いあいあいあいあ さあバグバグ さあバグバグ いないいないばあ
Holding hands, yeah yeah yeah yeah, now bug-bug, now bug-bug, peek-a-boo!

310
00:42:00,046 --> 00:42:05,046
いあいあいあいあ いあいあいあいあ
Yeah yeah yeah yeah, yeah yeah yeah yeah!

311
00:42:05,046 --> 00:42:16,564
さあ説教だ 感情論ばっかで語るなよ 踊れ踊れ 踊れ踊れ 揺ら揺ら
Now for a lecture, stop speaking purely in emotion, dance and dance, dance and dance, swaying around

312
00:42:42,064 --> 00:42:51,064
[Title: ODDS & ENDS 
 Lyrics, Music: ryo(supercell)]

313
00:43:17,536 --> 00:43:26,576
いつだって君は笑われ者だ やることもなすこともツイてなくて挙句に雨に降られて
You've always been the laughingstock, nothing you do ever goes right, and on top of that, you get caught in the rain.

314
00:43:27,486 --> 00:43:37,136
お気に入りの傘は風で飛んでって そこらの野良犬は心を踏みつけていった
Your favorite umbrella blew away in the wind, and some stray dog walked all over your heart.

315
00:43:47,446 --> 00:43:56,466
いつもどおり君は嫌われ者だ 何をするにも遠ざけられて 努力をしてみるけど
As usual, you're disliked by everyone, kept at a distance no matter what you do, even though you try your best.

316
00:43:57,496 --> 00:44:06,076
その理由なんてなんとなくだって 君は悲しそうに腰掛けてた
For no real reason at all, you sat there looking so sad.

317
00:44:06,966 --> 00:44:15,956
ならあたしの声を使えばいいよ 人によっては理解不能で なんて耳障り ひどい声だって
Well, then you can just use my voice! Though some might find it incomprehensible, a harsh, grating, terrible voice...

318
00:44:16,336 --> 00:44:26,716
言われるけど きっと君の力になれる だからあたしを歌わせてみせろ そう君の 君だけの言葉でさあ
They might say that, but I'm sure I can be of help to you. So let me sing! With your, your very own words, come on!

319
00:44:31,316 --> 00:44:41,346
綴って連ねて あたしがその言葉を叫ぶから 描いて理想を その想いは誰にも触れさせない
Spell it out, string it together, since I will shout those words! Paint your ideal, and I won't let anyone touch those feelings.

320
00:44:41,936 --> 00:44:51,526
ガラクタの声はそして響く ありのままを不器用につないで 目一杯に
Let the voice of junk resound, connecting your true self clumsily, with all your might!

321
00:44:51,966 --> 00:44:59,564
ガラクタの声はそして響く ありのままを不器用につないで 目一杯に
Let the voice of junk resound, connecting your true self clumsily, with all your might!

322
00:45:00,144 --> 00:45:01,624
大声を上げる
Raising my voice loud...

323
00:45:02,264 --> 00:45:05,224
いつからか君は人気者だ
Ever since then, you've become popular,

324
00:45:06,464 --> 00:45:08,644
たくさんの人に持て囃され
Fawned over by so many people,

325
00:45:09,184 --> 00:45:11,524
あたしもお鼻が高い
And for a while, I was also proud...

326
00:45:12,404 --> 00:45:15,724
でもいつからか君は変わった
But somewhere along the way, you changed.

327
00:45:16,224 --> 00:45:20,204
冷たくなって…だけど寂しそうだった
You grew cold... yet you looked so lonely.

328
00:45:21,644 --> 00:45:25,604
もう機械の声なんてたくさんだ、僕は僕自身なんだよって
"I've had enough of robotic voices, I am my own person!"

329
00:45:26,624 --> 00:45:31,324
ついに君は抑えきれなくなって、あたしを嫌った
Finally, you couldn't hold it back anymore, and you hated me.

330
00:45:32,484 --> 00:45:36,344
君の後ろで誰かが言う「虎の威を借りるキツネの群れに」
Behind you, someone says, "A pack of foxes riding the tiger's coattails..."

331
00:45:37,144 --> 00:45:41,444
ねぇ、君は一人で泣いてたんだね
Hey, you were crying all by yourself, weren't you?

332
00:45:46,504 --> 00:45:49,964
聴こえる？この声
Can you hear this voice?

333
00:45:50,124 --> 00:45:55,744
あたしがその言葉をかき消すから
I will drown out those words,

334
00:45:56,584 --> 00:46:05,724
わかってる、本当は君が誰より優しいってことを
I know... that truly, you are kinder than anyone else.

335
00:46:06,824 --> 00:46:15,844
ガラクタの声はそして歌った、他の誰でもない君のために走っていく、限界を超えて
The voice of scrap then sang, running for your sake, pushing past the limit!

336
00:46:17,144 --> 00:46:21,124
ふたりはどんなにたくさんの言葉を思いついたことだろう
How many countless words must the two of us have thought of?

337
00:46:21,824 --> 00:46:27,824
だけど今は何ひとつ思いつかなくて、だけど何もかもわかった
But right now, not a single one comes to mind, yet I understood everything.

338
00:46:28,024 --> 00:46:37,564
「そうか、きっとこれは夢だ。永遠に覚めない、君と出会えた、そんな夢だ」
"Ah, surely this is a dream. A dream that will never wake, where I met you."

339
00:46:41,184 --> 00:46:50,384
ガラクタは幸せそうな表情をしたまま、どれだけ呼んでももう動かない
The piece of scrap kept a happy expression, but no matter how much I called, it wouldn't move anymore.

340
00:46:51,224 --> 00:47:00,724
望んだはずの結末に君は泣き叫ぶ、嘘だろ？嘘だろ？ってそう泣き叫ぶ
You weep and shout at the ending you should have desired—"You're lying! You're lying!" you cry out.

341
00:47:06,984 --> 00:47:16,364
僕は無力だ、ガラクタひとつだって救えやしない
I am powerless; I can't even save a single piece of scrap.

342
00:47:16,964 --> 00:47:26,624
想いは涙にぽりぽりとその頬を濡らす、その時
Feelings turn into teardrops, pattering down to wet your cheeks, at that moment—

343
00:47:31,004 --> 00:47:36,824
世界は途端にその色を大きく変える
The world suddenly changes its colors dramatically.

344
00:47:37,144 --> 00:47:46,504
悲しみ、喜び、全てが一人さ、ひとつ知った
Sadness, joy, everything alone, I came to know one thing...

345
00:47:47,084 --> 00:47:51,684
言葉は歌になりこの世界を再び駆け巡る、君のために
Words turn into a song and race across this world once more, for your sake!

346
00:47:52,064 --> 00:48:00,244
その声に意志を宿して、今想いが響く
Giving will to that voice, now my feelings resound!

347
00:48:46,922 --> 00:48:52,572
[Title: TEMARI] [Text: Lyrics: LUMINA Music, Arrangement: seibin]

348
00:48:54,564 --> 00:49:01,384
さあ、散らばってしまった話を
Now, let's pick up the scattered stories...

349
00:49:01,904 --> 00:49:08,864
空に手を伸ばし始める
And start reaching our hands toward the sky.

350
00:49:09,184 --> 00:49:16,964
下を通り過ぎる曲がった線に
Along the crooked lines passing below...

351
00:49:17,504 --> 00:49:22,524
縛られた足をくすぐるの
Tickling our bound feet.

352
00:49:24,384 --> 00:49:31,824
鳴呼、落ちて汚れた意識を
Ah, a fallen and sullied consciousness...

353
00:49:32,484 --> 00:49:40,064
名前と呪術にかけて
Cast upon it names and spellcraft.

354
00:49:40,204 --> 00:49:54,744
空っぽだった体の夢見ていたまぶたが開く、心の奥からうごめく記憶
Eyelids that had only dreamed of an empty body open up, memories stirring from the depths of the heart...

355
00:50:00,160 --> 00:50:04,180
心の奥からうごめく記憶が
Memories stirring from deep within my heart

356
00:50:04,180 --> 00:50:09,580
混じった呪いと祝福が目の前を知ってるの？
Do you know what lies before us, a mixture of curse and blessing?

357
00:50:10,280 --> 00:50:18,180
始まりと終わりに向かって 果てに、帰ってくるのは
Heading toward the beginning and the end... In the end, what returns

358
00:50:18,180 --> 00:50:25,580
パパの呼び声だけ
is only Papa's calling voice.

359
00:50:25,580 --> 00:50:36,580
鳴呼、パパ、そこに居たら教えて欲しいの私が歩くこの道は
Ah, Papa, if you're there, please tell me, what color will this path I walk on be?

360
00:50:36,580 --> 00:50:43,280
どんな色だろう
What color could it be?

361
00:50:52,280 --> 00:51:05,580
さぁ、この調子の旋律を 空に手を伸ばし始める
Come now, beginning to reach my hands into the sky with this melody's tune

362
00:51:07,080 --> 00:51:14,580
散るが花遠くの誓いが
Scattering flowers, distant vows

363
00:51:15,580 --> 00:51:22,280
愛を掲げ泣き叫んでる
Raising love and crying out

364
00:52:00,580 --> 00:52:08,180
始まりと終わりに向かって 果てに、帰ってくるのは
Heading toward the beginning and the end... In the end, what returns

365
00:52:08,180 --> 00:52:15,580
救わなかった君の声
is the voice of you whom I couldn't save.

366
00:52:16,280 --> 00:52:24,080
愛しい妹そこに居たら教えて
Beloved younger sister, if you're there, please tell me

367
00:52:24,080 --> 00:52:34,080
君の手をいつかまた握れるのかな
Will I ever be able to hold your hand once again?

368
00:52:57,349 --> 00:52:59,429
Hello everyone,

369
00:52:59,709 --> 00:53:07,909
I hope you guys enjoyed the live, and now that the live is over, I got some announcements for you guys. Wow!

370
00:53:09,269 --> 00:53:13,769
Well, first of all, it is the merch now released. Woo!

371
00:53:14,369 --> 00:53:28,569
This time around, I'm going to be doing a re-released edition fashion special.

372
00:53:28,569 --> 00:53:37,749
You see some familiar and the most requested items you guys kind of told me about,

373
00:53:37,749 --> 00:53:43,809
so we're going to be releasing the TAKODEX hoodie re-released edition,

374
00:53:43,809 --> 00:53:53,569
and "Not-a-Bad-End" t-shirt re-released edition, the matching t-shirt with me,

375
00:53:53,569 --> 00:53:59,909
and of course, when you have clothes, you gotta have a nice way to wash those clothes,

376
00:53:59,909 --> 00:54:10,509
so I'm also going to be releasing "They-said-I-could-become-anything" Tako Mesh Laundry Pouch re-released edition. Wow!

377
00:54:10,509 --> 00:54:16,909
So all these items are re-released, which means that they're going to have a different tag from their original, you know, released versions.

378
00:54:16,909 --> 00:54:26,009
And these items are just the reproduction of the premium talent merch released in the past, and will have the special 2024 re-released edition label as the proof.

379
00:54:26,009 --> 00:54:31,509
And up next, we got line stamps!

380
00:54:31,509 --> 00:54:39,209
This is an official stamp pack that's going to be released right after this live, well, the stream, yes.

381
00:54:39,209 --> 00:54:44,309
Soon, very soon. And it's drawn by none other than yours truly, Ninomae Ina'nis.

382
00:54:44,309 --> 00:54:55,809
Honestly, I've always wanted like an easy-to-use stamp pack, and I use LINE a lot, so um I thought, you know, I'll take this chance to draw a whole set myself!

383
00:54:55,809 --> 00:55:01,409
I hope you guys like it, and I guess if you use LINE a bit, I hope you guys check it out.

384
00:57:07,688 --> 00:57:39,888
[Text: Thank you everyone for all your love and support! A lot happened while trying to put together this live so I'm really happy I can share this with everyone. Biggest thank you to all the Staff, Creators, friends, and of course, to you all who couldn't have done this happen! I really couldn't have done it lovely!! I poured my heart into this live so I hope you guys enjoyed it, as well. I'll continue doing my best in 2025 SO let's have another amazing year! Thank you, thank you, and thank you always! - Ninomae Ina'nis]

